</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S2.T3.3.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S2.T3.3.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_b ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:2.3pt;padding-bottom:2.3pt;">
<span id="S2.T3.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:120.8pt;">
<span id="S2.T3.3.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.T3.3.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Should catheter-directed thrombolytic therapy be considered for people with symptomatic iliofemoral deep vein thrombosis and symptoms for the past month?</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S2.T3.3.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_b ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:2.3pt;padding-bottom:2.3pt;">
<span id="S2.T3.3.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:165.6pt;">
