<td id="A6.T24.6.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A6.T24.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A6.T24.6.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.T24.6.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">question</span>: “What can you tell me about Albert Einstein?”</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T24.6.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T24.6.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A6.T24.6.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
