</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T24.6.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T24.6.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A6.T24.6.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A6.T24.6.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.T24.6.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">answer</span>: “Albert Einstein, born on 14 March 1879, was a German-born theoretical physicist, widely held to be one of the greatest and most influential scientists of all time. He received the 1921 Nobel Prize in Physics for his services to theoretical physics.”</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T24.6.5" class="ltx_tr">
